Name: acpica
URL: https://github.com/acpica/acpica
Version: 20260930
Revision: e85aa3bebaae81ed1e6d163511ac7e1eafe732cf
Security Critical: yes

License: BSD
License File: src/LICENSE

Description:
  operating system-independent implementation of
  the Advanced Configuration and Power Interface specification.
  Utilizing version 20260930.

Local Modifications:
  - Added README.fuchsia
  - Removed optional GPL license banner from legacy headers in sources
  - Added LICENSE containing copy of source license banner
  - Added BUILD.gn and OWNERS
  - Added symlink to wrap source/include as include/acpica
  - Modified source/include/platform/acenv.h to include acfuchsia.h
  - Guarded ACPI_FLEX_ARRAY in source/include/platform/acgcc.h for C++
  - Wrapped source/include/acpi.h with extern "C"
  - Added workaround for use-after-free on NuC in AcpiNsTerminate
  - Modified AcpiHwLegacySleep to fail transitions to S-states other than S5,
    which are not supported because ACPICA runs in usermode and cannot disable
    interrupts
